        "evidence": "hecke-satisfies-blitvic-hypothesis-proof.md:11-17 'odd length vanishes' invokes tr_M(x*sigma_i) = z*tr_M(x) for the unmatched factor; md:14-16 applies the Markov peel at an arbitrary internal generator sigma_i.",
